## Phase 4: Image Sync Preparation
-----------------------------------
Image sync methods:

METHOD 1: rsync (if you have SSH access to Magento server)
  rsync -avz --progress \
    /home/pim/public_html/public/media/product_images/ \
    user@magento-server:/path/to/magento/pub/media/catalog/product/

METHOD 2: FTP/SFTP (if no SSH access)
  - Use FileZilla or similar FTP client
  - Upload from: /home/pim/public_html/public/media/product_images/
  - Upload to: /pub/media/catalog/product/ on Magento server

METHOD 3: Magento media import
  - Place images in Magento's var/import/images/
  - Run: php bin/magento catalog:images:resize

## Phase 5: Post-Sync Commands
-------------------------------
After sync completes, run these on Magento server:

1. Reindex catalogs:
   php bin/magento indexer:reindex

2. Clear cache:
   php bin/magento cache:flush
   php bin/magento cache:clean

3. Regenerate static content (if needed):
   php bin/magento setup:static-content:deploy -f

4. Verify product count:
   php bin/magento catalog:product:count

